                                        "entry_id": "7aadc018-d919-3b3d-8ce4-6e3ee179a2b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any intrauterine device (abbreviation: IUD)—the first IUDs were coil-shaped."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e15e563d-0abf-4d97-ac40-aeaada7ff171",
                                                "sense_id": "89e1a2c4-1cd7-3b08-85c2-749ce8569065",
                                                "text": "‘I’m gonna go on the pill and get fitted for a coil. I don’t wanna be pregnant. Ever. Again!’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1bf98849-3750-36a8-9d65-5e95ceb54b63",
                                        "entry_id": "7aadc018-d919-3b3d-8ce4-6e3ee179a2b9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A coil of electrically conductive wire through which electricity can flow."
